! EXAM.DBG - examining and depositing (docs/PHASE-42.md, subtask 1), in
! a recursive call four deep: SHOW STACK; registers; the current and
! previous locations; type and radix qualifiers; ranges and lists;
! labels of data as arrays; numeric addresses; EVALUATE with MACRO's
! operators; DEPOSIT to memory and registers; SET MODE, SET RADIX, and
! CANCEL of each, with SHOW MODE and SHOW RADIX after each.
!
SET BREAK/AFTER:3 BACK
GO
CANCEL BREAK/ALL
SHOW CALLS
SHOW STACK
SHOW STACK 1
!
! Registers.
EXAMINE R0
EXAMINE R2
EXAMINE AP
EXAMINE FP
EXAMINE SP
EXAMINE PC
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE/PSL PSL
EXAMINE .SP
EXAMINE @SP
EXAMINE .AP+4
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
EXAMINE/OPERANDS .PC
!
! The current location, the next, and the previous.
EXAMINE WATCHL
EXAMINE
EXAMINE .
EXAMINE ^
!
! Types, sizes, and radixes.
EXAMINE SOURCE
EXAMINE/ASCII:16 SOURCE
EXAMINE/ASCII SOURCE
EXAMINE/BYTE SOURCE
EXAMINE/WORD SOURCE
EXAMINE/LONGWORD SOURCE
EXAMINE/QUADWORD SOURCE
EXAMINE/BYTE SOURCE:SOURCE+5
EXAMINE/DECIMAL/BYTE SOURCE:SOURCE+3
EXAMINE/HEXADECIMAL R2
EXAMINE/DECIMAL R2
EXAMINE/OCTAL R2
EXAMINE/BINARY R2
EXAMINE WATCHL, WATCHB, COUNT
EXAMINE WATCHB
EXAMINE BUFFER
EXAMINE BUFFER[2]
EXAMINE MSG
EXAMINE/NOSYMBOLIC WATCHL
!
! Numeric addresses (the DATA psect starts at 200).
EXAMINE 200
EXAMINE 200:20C
EXAMINE/BYTE 204
!
! EVALUATE: names, contents, registers, and MACRO's operators.
EVALUATE WATCHL
EVALUATE .WATCHL
EVALUATE/ADDRESS WATCHL
EVALUATE R2
EVALUATE R2+1
EVALUATE .R2
EVALUATE AP+4
EVALUATE 7 MOD 3
EVALUATE 5 EQL 5
EVALUATE 5 NEQ 5
EVALUATE 1@4
EVALUATE NOT 0
EVALUATE 6 AND 3
EVALUATE/DECIMAL 100
!
! DEPOSIT to memory and to registers.
DEPOSIT WATCHL = 7
EXAMINE WATCHL
DEPOSIT/BYTE WATCHB = 42
EXAMINE WATCHB
DEPOSIT/ASCII:4 BUFFER = "WXYZ"
EXAMINE/ASCII:4 BUFFER
DEPOSIT R3 = 99
EXAMINE R3
!
! Modes.
SHOW MODE
SET MODE NOSYMBOLIC
SHOW MODE
EXAMINE WATCHL
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
SHOW CALLS
SET MODE SYMBOLIC
SET MODE NOLINE
SHOW MODE
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
STEP
SET MODE LINE
SET MODE OPERANDS
SHOW MODE
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
SET MODE OPERANDS=FULL
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
SET MODE NOOPERANDS
SET MODE G_FLOAT
SHOW MODE
CANCEL MODE
SHOW MODE
!
! Radix.
SHOW RADIX
SET RADIX DECIMAL
SHOW RADIX
EXAMINE R2
EVALUATE 10
SET RADIX/OUTPUT OCTAL
SHOW RADIX
EXAMINE R2
EVALUATE 10
SET RADIX/INPUT HEXADECIMAL
SHOW RADIX
EVALUATE 10
CANCEL RADIX
SHOW RADIX
!
SHOW SCOPE
GO
